   Create a `.gitignore` file that ignores `node_modules/`, build artifacts, and environment files. The static files in `build/` (`manifest.json`, `popup.html`, `popup.css`) remain tracked.

   filename: .gitignore

   ```text
   node_modules/
   build/*.js
   build/*.js.map
